
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Iraqi Stars League</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
 margin:0;background:#0c1017;color:white;
 font-family:Arial,sans-serif
}
header{
 background:#171e29;padding:22px 16px;
 border-bottom:3px solid #c62828
}
header h1{margin:0;font-size:23px}
header p{color:#aaa}
nav{
 display:flex;gap:22px;padding:16px;
 overflow:auto;background:#121923
}
nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}
main{padding:16px;max-width:850px;margin:auto}
h2{font-size:19px}
.card{
 background:#171f2b;padding:17px;
 border-radius:13px;margin:14px 0;
 border:1px solid #293444
}
.highlight{border-left:4px solid #d32f2f}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
th,td{
 text-align:left;padding:12px 5px;
 border-bottom:1px solid #303a48
}
th{color:#aaa;font-size:12px}
.newroz{color:#ff5555;font-weight:bold}
footer{text-align:center;color:#777;padding:30px}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<h1>🇮🇶 IRAQI STARS LEAGUE</h1>
<p>Your home for Iraqi football</p>
</header>

<nav>
<a href="#table">Standings</a>
<a href="#scores">Results</a>
<a href="#fixtures">Fixtures</a>
<a href="#newroz">Newroz SC</a>
</nav>

<main>
<div class="card">
<h2>⚽ MATCH CENTRE</h2>
<p>Welcome to the Iraqi Stars League!</p>
<p>Live scores and match updates coming soon.</p>
</div>

<section id="table">
<h2>🏆 League Standings</h2>
<div class="card">
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>#</th><th>CLUB</th><th>PTS</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>1</td><td>Team 1</td><td>0</td></tr>
<tr class="newroz"><td>2</td><td>🔴 NEWROZ SC</td><td>0</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td>Team 3</td><td>0</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>

<section id="scores">
<h2>⚽ Latest Results</h2>
<div class="card">Match results will appear here.</div>
</section>

<section id="fixtures">
<h2>📅 Upcoming Fixtures</h2>
<div class="card">Upcoming games will appear here.</div>
</section>

<section id="newroz">
<h2>🔴 Newroz SC</h2>
<div class="card highlight">
<h3>NEWROZ SPORTS CLUB</h3>
<p>A city's hope.</p>
<p>Club founded in 1994.</p>
</div>
</section>
</main>

<footer>
IRAQI STARS LEAGUE • 2026/27
</footer>
</body>
</html>
